    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe 'mini.base16' has intentionally very minimal tree-sitter highlight groups definition in order to rely on defaults as much as possible. The 'mini.hues' is a bit different and already has `@tag.delimiter` different, so already taken care of.\r\n\r\nAny further tweaking can (and should) be done manually via `:highlight` command or `vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, ...)` Lua function call.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
